{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"時事全方位重點提要｜10月30日\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/MAG-PROMO-261030.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】政府公布宏福苑火災獨立委員會報告，並提出一系列問責及改革措施。這些措施的力度是否足夠？能否防止類似事件再次發生？</p><p>周五《時事全方位》，請來嘉賓討論。</p><p>題目：跟進宏福苑報告</p><p>熱線電話：1833298</p><p></p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-30T01:41:36.340094+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":106,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T10:27:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T05:40:13.893427+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-30T01:38:47.731255+00:00","content_hash":"e3c25448c317a9a47ae8ae94c7eb0e6ec8787d1ea80312c03270fe3b3603658d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-30T01:41:36.340094+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}